{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"uk-universal-credit UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Il suppose que l’indemnité maximale est versée avant que les revenus ne soient déjà connus. La limite ZXQPH0000QXZ s’applique au-delà de l’indemnité de travail sélectionnée : £ZXQPH0001QXZ avec aide au logement, £ZXQPH0002QXZ sans aide au logement, ou £ZXQPH0003QXZ si aucune allocation de travail ne s’applique. Les cas spéciaux et autres déductions sont exclus. Les règles s’appliquent à ZXQPH0004QXZ–ZXQPH0005QXZ et doivent être revues avant ZXQPH0006QXZ avril ZXQPH0007QXZ.","record_id":"c1a37c9bd013baf8353901cef56c219d09d86df0abe583219ce17adcb2e3e9c3","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.422586781124892,"source":"This illustrates the earnings taper only and does not check eligibility or calculate a full Universal Credit award. It assumes the maximum award before earnings is already known. The 55% taper applies above the selected work allowance: £427 with housing support, £710 without housing support, or £0 if no work allowance applies. Special cases and other deductions are excluded. Rules are for 2026–27 and must be reviewed before 6 April 2027.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"4a5506124846288e6347287158891c1e308abc590a854560b4a430683b0dab07","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Il suppose que l’indemnité maximale est versée avant que les revenus ne soient déjà connus. La limite 55% s’applique au-delà de l’indemnité de travail sélectionnée : £427 avec aide au logement, £710 sans aide au logement,